# Flights UDF benchmark (LANGUAGE hipy) — from udf-benchmark/benchmarks/lingodb/flights-hipy
# Smoke test: the benchmark UDFs compile and run on tiny inline data.
# The `flights` table is reduced to only the columns the benchmark query
# references (the original benchmark loads a 109-column CSV); the query text
# is unchanged.

